after = "Pool client limit; checkout; client wallet/archived lookup and disabled refusal; client account limit in autocommit; BEGIN; principal transaction lock and wallet recheck; client policy/reservation; COMMIT; client custody recheck; signing in short transactions on the same session; nonce session lock for transactions; client reservation/hash/recovery writes committed before submission; release; pool audit."
preserved = "Client then account then signed-operation refusals and all status mappings; account hits persist on policy and signing failures; daily charges and signed evidence commit independently; legacy and attestor custody still hold wallet SHARE locks during signing."

